---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Intro from "../components/Intro.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <Intro
    eyebrow="YOUR INFORMATION"
    title="Privacy, with clarity."
    description="Access JEA’s privacy policy and understand how the website’s inquiry form and tools handle your information."
  />
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>JEA’s privacy policy</h2>
      <p>
        The existing JEA BizDev Consulting privacy policy is available in its
        original format.
      </p>
      <a
        class="button"
        href="/Privacy%20Policy.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        Read the privacy policy (PDF)
      </a>
      <h2>When you get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        The inquiry form asks for your contact details, company, and a
        non-confidential description of your priorities. Reviewing a draft keeps
        those details in the current browser tab. Choosing “Send to JEA” submits
        them through the website’s Formcarry delivery service so JEA can
        respond.
      </p>
      <p>
        Choosing “Open email draft” passes your introduction to your email
        application. You decide whether to send it. Downloading an introduction
        saves a text file to your device.
      </p>
      <h2>When you use the tools</h2>
      <p>
        Calculator inputs are processed in your browser. The toolkit does not
        save or transmit them. Downloaded scenarios are saved to your device
        only. Site search also runs locally in the browser.
      </p>
      <h2>Website analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The production website retains Vercel Web Analytics for aggregate
        website usage. Calculator values and inquiry text are not added to
        analytics events.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about your information, contact{" "}
        <a href="mailto:jeabizdev@gmail.com">jeabizdev@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
